## The Native Shell renderer's host trait, implemented by the Rust
## Wasmtime provider in `native/`.
use dep.ui.{Command, Packet}

## What a host must provide. `apply!` consumes one batch of commands and
## `next_event_v2!` waits for the next user event; a handler of 0 ends the
## event loop.
@host
pub trait Surface:
    fn apply!(&mut self, commands: List[Command]) -> void
    fn next_event_v2!(&mut self) -> Packet
